{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XoaFBRR3UhU3BGBA72rCsy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 有驱动异常**（100% util/0 MiB），不可用，只用 GPU 0-2\\\\n- **HF 网络**: 必须设 `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1` 避免 HF Hub 请求挂起\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- OpenRouter endpoint: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`，API key key_id=`openai_api_key_direct`\\\\n- **[2026-05-20] API key 余额不足（402 Insufficient balance）**，需充值后才能跑 scoring\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n- exp-005 RATE control: `data/rate_control_input.jsonl` (88 条, NLI≥0.90 过滤)\\\\n\\\\n## RATE 方法 axis 可行性梯度（核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | 改变了什么 | NLI 策略 | Pass rate | 结论 |\\\\n|------|-----------|----------|-----------|------|\\\\n| Formality | 表面 register | Bidirectional min(fwd,bwd) | 88% ✅ | 完全可行 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 信息量 | Direction-aware (D012/D013) | 86% ✅ | 需 NLI-only gate + direction-aware |\\\\n| Register | 话语情境 | NLI-only (D019) | 95% ✅ | NLI-only gate，与 formality 正交 (50%) |\\\\n| Tone | 认知承诺 | Bidirectional | 45% ❌ | 结构性不可行 |\\\\n\\\\n**教训：RATE counterfactual 方法只适用于不改变命题语义的 style axis。**\\\\n- Formality：纯表面 register 变化 → bidirectional NLI 直接 work\\\\n- Verbosity：信息量变化 → direction-aware NLI 可适配（compression 用 forward，expansion 用 backward），但需 NLI-only gate（BERTScore 对长度变化敏感）\\\\n- Register：话语情境变化 → NLI-only gate（BERTScore 对词汇/句法变化敏感，同 verbosity 模式）\\\\n- Tone (assertive/hedging)：改变 epistemic commitment（\\\\\\\"X is\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"X might be\\\\\\\"），NLI 正确识别为非蕴含。6/20 条 NLI catastrophic failure (<0.01)。方向不对称：hedging→assertive 较好 (0.793)，assertive→hedging 失败 (0.656)\\\\n\\\\n## NLI Gate 特性（exp-013 发现）\\\\n\\\\nNLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) 是 **precision-oriented conservative filter**：\\\\n- Precision 98.9%（88 条 NLI pass 中仅 1 条 LLM-as-annotator 判为 NO）\\\\n- FNR 66.7%（12 条 NLI fail 中有 8 条 LLM 认为内容实际保持）\\\\n- Cohen's kappa = 0.43（低于 0.6），但这是 **kappa paradox** 导致：base rate 极度不平衡（88 pass vs 12 fail）时高 agreement (91%) 仍产生低 kappa (Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990)\\\\n- **论文 framing**：报告 precision/recall/F1 alongside kappa，引用 kappa paradox 文献\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 结果对比 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n| 指标 | 8B (mvp_8b_ate) | 32B (mvp_32b_ate) |\\\\n|------|-----------------|-------------------|\\\\n| H1 NLI pass rate | 95% | 88% |\\\\n| Corrected ATE | +0.1200 | +0.1023 |\\\\n| Corrected d | 0.117 | 0.104 |\\\\n| Corrected p | 0.246 | 0.332 |\\\\n\\\\n## Pairwise 诊断结果 (pairwise_32b) — ✅ SUCCESS\\\\n\\\\n| 指标 | 值 |\\\\n|------|----|\\\\n| N (consistent) | 55 / 98 valid (56.1%) |\\\\n| Formal win rate | 69.1% (38/55) |\\\\n| Sign test p | 0.0065 ** |\\\\n| 95% CI (Wilson) | [0.560, 0.797] |\\\\n| NLI≥0.90 子集 | 73.9% (34/46), p=0.0015 ** |\\\\n\\\\n**方向不对称性：** formal→casual 78.8% (p=0.001) vs casual→formal 54.5% (p=0.832)\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity direction-aware NLI (D012/D013)\\\\n\\\\nv1 bidirectional NLI: 65% → v2 direction-aware NLI: 86% (NLI-only gate)\\\\n- Forward (compression, n=46): 95.7% pass, NLI mean 0.9476\\\\n- Backward (expansion, n=54): 77.8% pass, NLI mean 0.8267\\\\n- BERTScore 对 verbosity 结构性不适用（expansion BS mean 0.6732），已去掉 BERTScore gate\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策点\\\\n- Formality pairwise PASS（69.1%, p=0.006）→ formality axis 有效\\\\n- Verbosity: direction-aware NLI 修复后 86% pass → 继续 scoring（等 API key）\\\\n- Register: NLI-only 95% pass → n=100 counterfactual gen 进行中\\\\n- Tone pilot FAIL（45%）→ 结构性不可行\\\\n- 方向不对称性仍未解决（78.8% vs 54.5%）\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Workers 无法长时间轮询（自动退出），长等待用 ScheduleWakeup 或 nohup+监控\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多：同数据 Likert p=0.33 → pairwise p=0.006\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Tone axis assertive→hedging 改变 epistemic commitment，NLI catastrophic failure（6/20 < 0.01）——不是模型/prompt 问题，是 axis 的语义性质决定的\\\\n- [2026-05-20] API key `openai_api_key_direct` 402 余额不足，scoring 全部失败（100 条 null）——需清空残留文件再 resume\\\\n- [2026-05-21] M003/M004/M005 教训：所有实验数字必须来自 SSH 实际执行 + 输出文件验证。本地改代码不等于服务器改代码。\\\\n- [2026-05-21] exp-013 kappa paradox：高 agreement (91%) + 低 kappa (0.43) 因 base rate skew。报告 NLI gate 质量时用 precision/recall 而非只报 kappa。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4589, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XDoVSF7XnEkTJwb91SCbTM","session_id":"cb8e4d9c-e5c9-4ff7-827a-6c216d215011","uuid":"3ce19a3b-124f-4131-bc9c-f253b5c79a18","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:55:33.602Z"}
